# COMPONENT

## SingleRecordSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.aggregatesinglerecord

### DESCRIPTION

Single-record aggregate sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This sample demonstrates the encoded single-record aggregate pattern.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

`Order` is the persisted `Entity`.
`OrderLine` is a `Value Object` embedded inside `Order`.
The aggregate is restored from one record rather than application-joined from multiple entities.

# VALUE

## OrderLine

### DESCRIPTION

Value object stored inside `Order`.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name     | type | multiplicity |
|----------+------+--------------|
| name     | name | 1            |
| quantity | int  | 1            |

# ENTITY

## Order

### DESCRIPTION

Order aggregate encoded in one entity record.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type      | multiplicity |
|--------+-----------+--------------|
| id     | entityid  | 1            |
| name   | name      | 1            |
| status | string    | 1            |
| lines  | OrderLine | *            |

# SERVICE

## Order

### DESCRIPTION

Order-facing operations for the single-record aggregate pattern.
